    {
      "id": 18593,
      "nameEs": "Farm Frenzy: Animal Country",
      "originalName": "Farm Frenzy: Animal Country",
      "year": 2010,
      "igdbId": 201278,
      "popularity": 0,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Farm Frenzy: Animal Country",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Farm Frenzy: Animal Country",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Have you ever wanted to be a farmer? In Farm Frenzy: Animal Country that's just what you become as you go down on the farm where the fun never stops. Here players take control of every aspect of running their own farm, including milking the cows, feeding the chickens, collecting eggs and finally, shipping your produced goods to market. The money you earn can be spent on expanding your production in a variety of ways like buying new livestock or maybe a new barn or other buildings like a bakery to add to your farming empire. But even in the most tranquil farm environments there are dangers to be wary of, around your farm that will be a group of nasty bears. They'll destroy everything if you let them. Be successful in all areas and your farm will prosper and you may even be rewarded with the 19 different achievement awards available",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¿Alguna vez has querido ser granjero? En Farm Frenzy: Animal Country eso es precisamente lo que te conviertes, en una granja donde la diversión nunca se acaba. Aquí los jugadores toman el control de cada aspecto de la gestión de su propia granja, incluidos ordeñar vacas, alimentar gallinas, recoger huevos y, finalmente, enviar los productos al mercado. El dinero que ganes puede gastarse en expandir tu producción de diversas formas, como comprar ganado nuevo, un granero nuevo u otros edificios, como una panadería, para ampliar tu imperio agrícola. Pero incluso en los entornos más tranquilos hay peligros que vigilar: un grupo de osos desagradables. Lo destruirán todo si los dejas. Si tienes éxito en todas las áreas, tu granja prosperará e incluso podrías recibir los 19 distintos premios de logros disponibles.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2010",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
